				"&6&lHow AE2 Works in Tech, Scales & Rockets:",
				"&8• &ePhase 0 (Ad-Hoc Era): &7The &dME Controller&7 is locked! However, as soon as you make &fIndustrial Foregoing Plastic&7, you can craft &dFluix Glass Cables&7 and build an &b8-Channel Ad-Hoc Network&7.",
				"&8• &ePhase 1B (Controller Era): &7Defeating the Hydra, Alpha Yeti, and Snow Queen unlocks the &dME Controller&7 (32 channels per face!), P2P Tunnels, and full Autocrafting.",
